cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: EmrysFilter
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
abstract: >-
  A header-only C++23 library for sequential Bayesian estimation, built on Eigen. It implements
  the Kalman filter with its square-root and information forms, the Gaussian mixture,
  interacting multiple model, particle, grid, Rao-Blackwellized, and hidden Markov filters, and
  smoothers for each, over states composed of vectors, angles, unit quaternions, and discrete
  modes. The documentation cites the published source of each algorithm.
authors:
